  lines:
  - text: 'Hey, featherweight! Think those wings can beat those beasts? '
  - text: 'Dive <color=#FF3333>into the water</color>, <color=#FF3333>follows the arrows</color>. '
  - text: <color=#FF3333>NO FLYING OUT OF WATER!</color>. We fly under the water, capisce?
